@startuml runtime
title Runtime View - CQRS request flow through IBus/MediatR\nTop: read path (query). Bottom: write path (state command).
caption Every operation crosses the same spine: UI -> API -> IBus -> MediatR -> Handler (DataAccess) -> SQL Server.

skinparam defaultFontName Segoe UI
skinparam sequence {
  ArrowColor #34495E
  LifeLineBorderColor #95A5A6
  GroupBorderColor #7F8C8D
  ParticipantBorderColor #34495E
}
skinparam BoxPadding 12
autonumber "<b>0."

actor User #White
box "Browser" #FDF3E7
  participant "Blazor UI\n(UI.Client/Shared)" as UI
end box
box "Web host (UI.Server)" #EAF2F8
  participant "API Controller\n(UI.Api)" as API
  participant "IBus\n(Core)" as BUS
  participant "MediatR" as MED
  participant "Handler\n(DataAccess)" as H
end box
box "Infrastructure" #E8F6EF
  database "SQL Server\n(EF Core DataContext)" as DB
  participant "NServiceBus\n(Worker)" as NSB
end box

== Query (read): WorkOrderByNumber ==
User -> UI : open work order
UI -> API : HTTP POST WebServiceMessage
API -> BUS : Send(WorkOrderByNumberQuery)
BUS -> MED : IMediator.Send
MED -> H : WorkOrderQueryHandler.Handle
H -> DB : AsNoTracking().SingleOrDefaultAsync
DB --> H : WorkOrder
H --> UI : WorkOrder (via response)

== State command (write): DraftToAssigned ==
User -> UI : click Assign
UI -> API : HTTP POST
API -> BUS : Send(IStateCommand)
BUS -> MED : IMediator.Send
MED -> H : StateCommandHandler.Handle
H -> H : command.Execute(context)\n(ChangeTracker.Clear + Attach/Add)
H -> DB : SaveChangesAsync
H -> NSB : PublishAsync(StateTransitionEvent)\n(null for most commands)
H --> UI : StateCommandResult
@enduml
